@* Store invokes its own StoreCustomerReportRegistered component (Grand.Web.Store/Components), not
   Admin's CustomerReportRegistered — the Admin component's base class (BaseAdminViewComponent) is
   not usable from the Store app. Both components are functionally identical (same permission check,
   same view). Extracted into a per-host satellite following the same pattern as this Reports
   migration's WidgetZone.*.cshtml partials. *@
@{
    @await Component.InvokeAsync("StoreCustomerReportRegistered")
}
